<h1 class="heading">Anand Karaj Date Approved</h1>

<p class="text">
  Waheguru Ji Ka Khalsa, Waheguru Ji Ki Fateh. We're pleased to confirm your requested date for your Anand Karaj at our Gurdwara Sahib. To proceed with the booking, please download and complete the form below.
</p>

<div class="card">
  <p class="card-title">
    {@event.occasion}
  </p>

  <p class="card-text">
    <span class="label">Type:</span>
    {@event.event_type.display_name}
  </p>

  <p class="card-text">
    <span class="label">Date:</span>
    {format_date_range(@event.start, @event.end)}
  </p>

  <p class="card-text">
    <span class="label">Time:</span>
    {format_time(@event.start)} - {format_time(@event.end)}
  </p>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <p class="card-title">Reference Number</p>

  <p class="card-text">
    <span class="label">Event ID:</span>
    {@event.id}
  </p>

  <p class="small-text muted">
    Please include this reference number in any communications about your event.
  </p>
</div>

<a
  href="https://singhsabha.net/documents/anand_karaj_booking.pdf"
  class="button"
  target="_blank"
>
  Download Booking Form
</a>

<div class="card">
  <p class="card-title">Before You Submit</p>
  <ul class="checklist">
    <li>
      Both the bride and groom must be Sikh and/or accept Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji as their eternal Guru.
    </li>
    <li>Bookings must be made at least <span class="label">4–6 weeks in advance</span>.</li>
    <li>Government-issued ID copies of both the bride and groom are required.</li>
    <li>The suggested deposit/donation must be paid upon confirmation of the booking.</li>
    <li>A consultation with Gurdwara representatives may be required.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <p class="card-title">Important Reminders</p>
  <ul class="checklist">
    <li>
      <span class="label">Dress code:</span>
      Head coverings are mandatory for all. Attire must be modest and respectful.
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="label">Music:</span>
      Only Gurbani Kirtan is permitted in the Darbar Hall. No drones indoors.
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="label">Decor:</span>
      No flower petals, confetti, or candles. All external vendors must be pre-approved.
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="label">Langar:</span>
      Only vegetarian food is allowed. Must be coordinated with the Langar Committee.
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="label">Prohibited:</span>
      No alcohol, drugs, smoking, or dowry exchanges on Gurdwara grounds.
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>

<p class="text">
  Once completed, email your form to <a href="mailto:bookings@singhsabha.net">bookings@singhsabha.net</a>. A Gurdwara representative will be in touch to confirm your booking and provide further details.
</p>

<p class="text muted italic" style="font-size: 0.875rem;">
  Please note: This inbox is not monitored. For questions, contact us directly at <a href="mailto:bookings@singhsabha.net">bookings@singhsabha.net</a>.
</p>

<div class="footer">
  <img
    src="https://singhsabha.net/images/logo.png"
    alt="Singh Sabha Logo"
    class="logo"
  />
  <p>
    <a href="https://singhsabha.net/" target="_blank">SinghSabha.net</a>, serving the Sikh community with devotion and compassion.
  </p>
</div>
